    d("long_constraints", "For the rest of this conversation, call me Captain and keep answers to one sentence.", "Understood, Captain. One sentence from now on.", "What's the capital of Peru?", "The capital of Peru is Lima, Captain.", "And of Chile?", "Santiago, Captain.", "Explain why the sky is blue.", "Air scatters short blue wavelengths of sunlight more than longer red ones, so blue light reaches your eyes from all directions, Captain.", "Thanks. Can you stop calling me Captain?", "Of course, I'll drop the title.")
    d("long_constraints", "I'm vegan, I'm training for a 10k, and I have 30 minutes to cook. Remember that.", "Noted: vegan, 10k training, 30 minutes cooking time. What do you want to make?", "A dinner for tonight.", "Try a chickpea and sweet potato curry with rice: chop a sweet potato small so it cooks in 15 minutes, simmer with a can of chickpeas, coconut milk and curry paste. It has carbohydrate for training and plant protein. Total about 30 minutes.", "And a snack for after the run?", "A banana with peanut butter on toast, or a soy yoghurt with oats and berries. Both are vegan, with carbohydrate and protein for recovery.", "Breakfast for tomorrow, same rules.", "Overnight oats with soy milk, chia seeds and berries, prepared tonight, so it takes no time tomorrow. It fits your vegan diet, and the 30-minute limit isn't an issue.")
    d("long_constraints", "You're my study buddy. Only ask me questions; don't give answers unless I say 'reveal'.", "Deal. What topic are we studying?", "The water cycle.", "What are the main stages of the water cycle?", "Evaporation, condensation, precipitation.", "Good. What drives evaporation?", "The Sun heating water.", "Right. And where does the water go after precipitation?", "reveal", "After precipitation, water either runs off over land into rivers and the sea, soaks into the ground as infiltration or groundwater, or is stored as snow and ice. Then the cycle repeats. Want another question?")
