    d("ellipsis", "How do you say 'thank you' in Italian?", "\"Grazie.\"", "More formally?", "\"La ringrazio\" (formal, you), or \"Grazie mille\" for a stronger thank you. For a very formal setting, \"La ringrazio molto\".", "And 'you're welcome'?", "\"Prego.\" It also means 'please' or 'go ahead' in many contexts.", "And in Portuguese?", "\"Obrigado\" if you're male, \"obrigada\" if you're female, and \"de nada\" for you're welcome.")
