    d("scenario", "I'm making a playlist. I have 12 songs, each about 3.5 minutes.", "That's 12 x 3.5 = 42 minutes.", "My workout is 45 minutes.", "You're 3 minutes short. One more song of 3.5 minutes brings it to 45.5 minutes, which covers the workout.", "I'd like a 5-minute cooldown track at the end.", "Then the main part is 40 minutes: 11 songs make 38.5 minutes, 12 make 42. With 12 songs (42 minutes) plus the 5-minute cooldown track, the total is 47 minutes. You'd slightly exceed the 45 minutes; dropping one song gives 38.5 + 5 = 43.5.", "Which one is better?", "If you want to match 45 minutes closely, use 12 songs + cooldown (47 minutes) and stop the playlist at the end of your workout, or use 11 songs + cooldown (43.5) and add a short intro. The 11-song version is closer to the target without cutting a song mid-way.")
